@startuml

title ComponentHub - Search Catalogue

actor User
participant "Search page\n(app.js)" as UI
participant "Catalogue client\n(catalogue.js)" as Client
participant "Express API" as API
database "SQLite" as DB

User -> UI: Enter keyword query
UI -> UI: Update URL query parameter
UI -> Client: search(query)
Client -> API: GET /api/search?q=query\nAuthorization: JWT
API -> DB: Search names, descriptions,\ntechnology and keywords
DB --> API: Matching components
API -> DB: Increment queried_not_used_count\nfor each result and write query log
API --> Client: Query results
Client -> Client: Merge results into local cache
Client --> UI: Normalized results
UI -> User: Display result count and cards

alt Empty query
  UI -> Client: Load all cached components
  Client --> UI: Cached catalogue
  UI --> User: Display all components
else Request fails or session expires
  API --> Client: Error response
  Client --> UI: Throw error or redirect to login
  UI --> User: Show error
end
@enduml
